      "worked": "Using the complement rule:\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A)&=1-0.6\\\\P(A)&=0.4\\\\P(B)&=1-0.5\\\\P(B)&=0.5\\\\P(A\\cup B)&=1-0.3\\\\P(A\\cup B)&=0.7\\end{align*}$$\nRearranging the addition rule:\n$$\\begin{align*}P(A\\cap B)&=P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cup B)\\\\P(A\\cap B)&=0.4+0.5-0.7\\\\P(A\\cap B)&=0.2\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
